.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]A young but gifted sorcerer of the secretive Order
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]of the Fallen Star, Auren volunteered to use
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]forbidden Time Magic to investigate a dire omen
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]glimpsed by the Order's seer. The spell stranded
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]him in 21st-century Japan and left him with the
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]body of a teenager, unable to reverse the effect.
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]With no way home, Auren has resolved to hunt
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]down whatever threat he was sent to find.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Serious and stubborn, Auren struggles
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]with the indignity of being treated as a
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]mere teenager despite his true age, and
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]often acts with an old-fashioned sense of
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]authority he hasn't earned in this era. He's
.L 417.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]awkward around women and, for reasons
.L 427.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]of his own, deeply distrustful of animals.
.CP
.SH
\&Auren: Attacks
.PP
\&Orion: Auren's sword, crafted from unbreakable adamantite, is as beautiful as it is deadly.
.PP
\&Fireball: Auren sends forth a spiralling blast of flame. Its magic continues to burn after it hits.
.PP
\&Ice Spire Array: A prismatic array of frozen shards bombards multiple enemies, piercing any defenses.
.PP
\&Thunder Godspell: Auren summons a bolt of electrical energy that stuns its target. It rarely misses.
.SH
\&Auren: Fluff
.PP
\&Concept: Time Skipping Sorcerer, Birthday: June 24, Age: 44 (Appears 16), Gender: Male, Height: 5'10", Weight: 152 lbs., Hair: Grey-Blue, Eyes: Grey, Association: Order of the Fallen Star, Hobbies: Fencing, Favorite Food: Mutton, Allies: None, Enemies: Mysterious Evil from the Future.
